With a global footprint spanning some 80&nbsp;countries, our company is home to dedicated employees who are passionate about advancing our mission: “Health for all, Hunger for none.” To learn more about how Bayer is making a difference, we asked three people to share their stories – stories that will undoubtedly resonate with many people around the world.
“I want to see a society without hunger” 
Margaret used to harvest only two to three bags of corn per season – making it impossible to sustain a family. However, all that changed thanks to her collaboration with Bayer, with Margaret now reaping the rewards of increased crop yields while also teaching other farmers how to optimize their harvests and cultivation methods.
